;===============================================================
; ProxyLayer (ProxyLayer.aux2) English display pack
; Place in: Language\  (e.g. C:\ProgramData\aviutl2\Language\)
; Apply with: AviUtl2  Setup -> Language -> select this file
;             (or drag & drop the .aul2 onto the preview window)
;---------------------------------------------------------------
; Only DISPLAY names are replaced. Internal item keys
; (画像ファイル / 档位 / 原始宽 ...) and everything saved inside
; .aup2 projects stay untouched, so existing projects keep working.
;===============================================================

[Language]
Information=ProxyLayer English display pack r1
SubLanguage=English

[ProxyLayer]
; --- effect label ---
代理图层=Proxy Layer

; --- items ---
ProxyLayer 代理图层 | 请在下方可选「画像ファイル」指定素材（替换原图像输入），不是叠加在画像ファイル之后=ProxyLayer | Pick the source image in "Image File" below. This REPLACES the image input of the object; it is not an overlay effect on top of an image file.
画像ファイル=Image File
モード=Mode
原图直通=Original image passthrough
档位=Proxy scale
导出时强制原图=Force original on export
输出探针日志=Write probe log
显示代理标记=Show proxy marker
模拟导出态=Simulate export state
本图层保持原图=Keep this layer at full resolution
原始宽=Original width
原始高=Original height
未设置=Not set
原始效果名=Original effect name
原始文件名项=Original file item name
